  dct:description """A film of historical significance to Greek cinema, it turned the world’s attention to Yiorgos Lanthimos, went all the way to the Oscars, became the emblem of the so-called Greek “weird wave” and endures as a pitch black, sardonic, post-modern riddle. A film of historical significance to Greek cinema, it turned the world’s attention to Yiorgos Lanthimos, went all the way to the Oscars, became the emblem of the so-called Greek “weird wave” and endures as a pitch black, sardonic, post-modern riddle. A film of historical significance to Greek cinema, it turned the world’s attention to Yiorgos Lanthimos, went all the way to the Oscars, became the emblem of the so-called Greek “weird wave” and endures as a pitch black, sardonic, post-modern riddle. 
A film of historical significance to Greek cinema, it turned the world’s attention to Yiorgos Lanthimos, went all the way to the Oscars, became the emblem of the so-called Greek “weird wave” and endures as a pitch black, sardonic, post-modern riddle. A film of historical significance to Greek cinema, it turned the world’s attention to Yiorgos Lanthimos, went all the way to the Oscars, became the emblem of the so-called Greek “weird wave” and endures as a pitch black, sardonic, post-modern riddle. 
A film of historical significance to Greek cinema, it turned the world’s attention to Yiorgos Lanthimos, went all the way to the Oscars, became the emblem of the so-called Greek “weird wave” and endures as a pitch black, sardonic, post-modern riddle. 
vol3 """@en;
